###Mapping
Mapping test::sableridge2::mapping::RidgeCrossMapping
(
  include mapping test::sableridge2::mapping::RidgeMapping
  include mapping test::sableridge2::mapping::StayDigestM2M

  test::sableridge2::domain::DigestOnHut: XStore
  {
    hutDigests[hut, digest]: $this.hutCode == $that.hutCode,
    digestHut[digest, hut]: $this.hutCode == $that.hutCode
  }
)
